---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - moonine" description="Read the Privacy Policy for moonine Vedic Matchmaker. Learn how we handle your registration details, astrological calculations, and profile safety.">
	<h1 style="border-bottom: 3px solid var(--bumble-yellow); padding-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: var(--font-2xl); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Privacy Policy</h1>

	<div style="font-size: var(--font-base); color: var(--bumble-text); line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 1rem;">
		<p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Last Updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

		<p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">At <strong>moonine - A Vedic Matchmaker</strong>, your privacy and trust are our top priorities. We are committed to protecting your personal information and providing a safe, transparent, and respectful matchmaking experience. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your details.</p>

		<h2 style="font-size: var(--font-lg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bumble-border); padding-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--bumble-text); font-weight: 800;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
		<p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">To perform high-precision astronomical Vedic calculations and find your ideal cosmic matches, we collect the following categories of information:</p>
		<ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Authentication Credentials:</strong> Your 10-digit mobile number and a user-selected 4-digit PIN. This is used solely to authenticate your profile and ensure security, avoiding device-only cookies.</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Astrological & Birth Details:</strong> Your Name, Date of Birth (DOB), Time of Birth (TOB), Gender, and Birth Location. This high-precision data is used to calculate your Nakshatra, Moon Sign, and planetary alignments.</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Optional Profile Fields:</strong> Contact Number, Current Location, Height, Religion/Community, Education, Occupation, Annual Income, and an "About Me" / Bio description.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 style="font-size: var(--font-lg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bumble-border); padding-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--bumble-text); font-weight: 800;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
		<p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">We use your information exclusively to provide a high-quality matchmaking experience:</p>
		<ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">To calculate Guna Milan and Ashta Koota compatibility scores (out of 36 points) between you and other potential partners.</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">To display relevant, gender-filtered profiles on your personalized Cosmic Dashboard.</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">To dynamically sort matches based on geographical proximity and astrological compatibility.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 style="font-size: var(--font-lg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bumble-border); padding-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--bumble-text); font-weight: 800;">3. Data Sharing and Protection</h2>
		<p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Your sensitive data is safe with us:</p>
		<ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>No Public Contact Details:</strong> We never display your contact number, email, or exact birth times publicly on match cards. Only calculated astrological values, bio, and general fields are shared.</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Vetted Introductions:</strong> To facilitate connection safely, interested parties must email our coordinator at <a href="mailto:rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com" style="color: var(--bumble-text-light); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold;">rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com</a> with a specific User ID. We personally vet and review inquiries before any contact details are securely exchanged.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 style="font-size: var(--font-lg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bumble-border); padding-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--bumble-text); font-weight: 800;">4. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
		<p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">To maintain your session state securely and optimize page loads, we utilize standard browser mechanisms:</p>
		<ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use an encrypted `user_details` cookie and a `uid` cookie to keep you logged in to your personalized dashboard safely.</li>
			<li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Local Storage:</strong> We cache calculated matchmaking data (for up to 30 minutes) to eliminate redundant API calls and optimize loading times.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 style="font-size: var(--font-lg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bumble-border); padding-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--bumble-text); font-weight: 800;">5. Your Rights and Control</h2>
		<p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">You are in complete control of your data. You can log in and update or delete your profile information at any time via the "Edit Profile" dashboard page. If you have any inquiries, data deletion requests, or concerns, please contact us at <a href="mailto:rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com" style="color: var(--bumble-text-light); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold;">rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com</a>.</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
